    "text": "An ideal gas is expanding such as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math>. The coefficient of volume expansion of the gas is",
